**/.DS_Store

# macOS custom folder icons, created by Finder and Dropbox. The real name is
# "Icon" plus a trailing carriage return, which git status hides and R CMD
# check rejects as a non-portable file name, so match it with a wildcard.
Icon?

# pkgdown build output. The site is built from README.md, vignettes/, man/ and
# _pkgdown.yml by .github/workflows/pkgdown.yaml and deployed to gh-pages.
# Never edit files in docs/ directly -- the CI build overwrites them.
/docs/
